 been added to SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition, including project management, procurement, finance, and asset management. These updates demonstrate the continuous effort to improve and expand the capabilities of the platform, making it more comprehensive and user-friendly. [Data: Records (6, 7, 8, 9, 10), Date_Range ((2024, 11, 26), (2025, 09, 14))]\n\n## Joule's Capabilities and Updates\n\nJoule has been continuously updated and expanded to support new use cases and features, including project management, procurement, finance, and asset management. The records provided highlight various updates and enhancements, such as the addition of new use cases, improved navigation, and enhanced analytical insights. [Data: Records (11, 12, 13, 14, 15), Date_Range ((2024, 12, 13), (2025, 09, 14))]", "# Joule SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition Overview\n\nThis report provides an overview of the Joule SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition, highlighting key components, their relationships, and significant updates. The information is relevant to the SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition as of December 2024.\n\n## Joule's Human Resources Capabilities\n\nJoule has introduced new use cases and upgraded existing transactional cases in the human resources domain, including navigation to widely used apps and viewing business data. These capabilities are essential for efficient human resources management and support the company's strategic planning processes. [Data: Sources (81, 82), Date_Range ((2024, 12, 13), (2024, 12, 20))]\n\n## Joule's Technology Capabilities\n\nJoule has expanded its capabilities in the technology domain, introducing new use cases for product lifecycle management, enterprise portfolio and project management, and service. These enhancements support the company's technology strategy and enable efficient management of complex projects. [Data: Sources (83, 84, 87), Date_Range ((2024, 11, 26), (2024, 12, 13))]\n\n## Joule's Finance Capabilities\n\nJoule has introduced new use 